449	     * Rolls a registration date forward to a business day: a Saturday or Sunday advances to the
450	     * following Monday, while a weekday is returned unchanged. Applied to the effective
451	     * registration date (whether supplied in the request or defaulted to the server date) so the
452	     * persisted registration date, every value derived from it and the per-day create-limit all
453	     * use the adjusted business day.
